abstract: >-
  Instrument 01 is a modular research-software suite for evidence-governed
  AI-assisted technical work, including orchestration, formal reasoning,
  research discovery, method synthesis, engineering verification, evaluation,
  process assurance, independent review, decision preflight, and adaptive
  complementary assistance. Rigilum is a working pre-product identity and is
  not represented by this metadata as a legally cleared corporate or trademark name.